  "displayName": "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 (RGB LED on GPIO38)",
  "description": "GPIO capability map for the v1.1 revision of the Espressif ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1, mirroring firmware/src/core/board/BoardProfile.cpp (makeEsp32S3DevKitC1V11). The v1.1 board drives its on-board RGB LED from GPIO38 (reserved); GPIO48 is free. The original (v1.0) board uses GPIO48 instead - see esp32-s3-devkitc-1.json. GPIO22-25 do not exist on the ESP32-S3 and are omitted.",
  "reference": "SPECIFICATION.md sections 11.4 / 11.5",
